  "how": "craft3d-cli of that commit (a debug build, on the developer's laptop): craft3d-cli run --new '{\"units\": \"mm\"}' --script v75.steps.json --out v75.3dcraft, then craft3d-cli run v75.3dcraft --cmd document.inspect for the features and bodies and --cmd note.list for the notes (their times left out: the clock of the writing build); format 75: a plate 40 x 20 x t (t 5 mm, then 7 mm) drilled by a pin of radius 3 through its middle (Drilled, 40 * 20 * 7 - 9 pi * 7 = 5402.07 mm3), and the notes pinned to it: 1 by the person on the plate's top (F1:face(1), followed into Drilled), done by the agent Claude Code with a reply; 2 by that agent on the pin's wall (F2:face(0), followed into Drilled), open; 3 on a face of a lug that was deleted afterwards (detached, at its point); 4 on the body of Drilled; 5 deleted again (next id 6)",
